sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Angular
  participant JF as JwtAuthenticationFilter
  participant AS as AuthService
  participant DB as Oracle
  U->>FE: username + password
  FE->>AS: POST /api/auth/login
  AS->>DB: load user + roles + permissions
  AS-->>FE: JWT + user profile (roles, permissions)
  FE->>JF: request with Bearer token
  JF->>DB: is token hash in oc_token_blacklist?
  JF-->>FE: 401 if invalid or blacklisted, 403 if permission missing
  FE->>AS: POST /api/auth/refresh (old token)
  AS->>DB: blacklist old token
  AS-->>FE: new JWT
  FE->>AS: POST /api/auth/logout
  AS->>DB: blacklist token
